---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FolderInput from '../components/FolderInput.astro';
---

<Layout title="Security Checker — Audit Any Project for Vulnerabilities" description="Open-source security validation checker. Scan repositories and cloud architectures against thousands of known vulnerabilities, CWEs, CVEs, and attack patterns.">
  <FolderInput />

  <section class="features-section">
    <h2>What does the Security Checker scan for?</h2>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Injection Vulnerabilities</h3>
        <p>SQL injection, command injection, XSS, path traversal, and code injection patterns from CWE and Nuclei templates.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Hardcoded Secrets</h3>
        <p>API keys, passwords, AWS credentials, tokens, and other secrets embedded directly in source code.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Known CVEs &amp; Exploits</h3>
        <p>Cross-references your dependencies against NVD, EPSS scores, CISA KEV, and public exploit databases.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>MITRE ATT&CK Patterns</h3>
        <p>Checks for techniques used by adversaries — privilege escalation, lateral movement, persistence, and defense evasion.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>Container &amp; Cloud Security</h3>
        <p>Docker misconfigurations, running as root, exposed debug ports, missing health checks, and cloud IAM issues.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <h3>MCP for AI Agents</h3>
        <p>Built-in Model Context Protocol server so AI agents can programmatically audit and fix security issues.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .features-section {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .features-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    text-align: center;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }

  .feature-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
